WEBVTT

00:00:14.292 --> 00:00:15.708
<i>Towa and Setsuna.</i>

00:00:15.833 --> 00:00:20.583
<i>Between us half-demon twins,</i>
<i>two different worlds exist at the same time.</i>

00:00:21.833 --> 00:00:23.333
<i>Human and demon.</i>

00:00:23.417 --> 00:00:25.250
<i>Feudal era and present day.</i>

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:27.292
<i>Peacefulness and war.</i>

00:00:27.542 --> 00:00:29.250
<i>Joy and sorrow.</i>

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:30.333
<i>Dreams and reality.</i>

00:00:30.917 --> 00:00:32.417
<i>One moment and eternity.</i>

00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:35.375
<i>And finally, love and hate.</i>

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:39.208
<i>A Feudal Fairytale,</i>
<i>Yashahime: Princess Half-Demon.</i>

00:00:39.667 --> 00:00:43.375
<i>We'll keep moving forward</i>
<i>through the hurdles of destiny!</i>

00:00:46.833 --> 00:00:49.000
Well, well, Mr. Higurashi,
is that you?

00:00:49.458 --> 00:00:51.417
Good evening, Mr. Higurashi.

00:00:51.708 --> 00:00:54.333
Sorry, I don't recall your name.

00:00:54.625 --> 00:00:58.583
I'm Miss Towa's homeroom teacher,
Osamu Kirin.

00:00:58.792 --> 00:01:00.875
SOTA HIGURASHI, MEI HIGURASHI
Oh, hello.

00:01:00.875 --> 00:01:03.333
SOTA HIGURASHI, MEI HIGURASHI
Good evening, Mr. Kirin.

00:01:03.333 --> 00:01:05.333
How is Miss Towa doing these days?

00:01:05.875 --> 00:01:08.750
Ever since she transferred,
she's been absent.

00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:14.083
Yes, well, her neuralgia has subsided,
but her rheumatism is still...

00:01:14.875 --> 00:01:16.292
I do hope she takes care.

00:01:16.292 --> 00:01:17.542
I'm back!

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:19.500
Thank you for picking me up.

00:01:19.792 --> 00:01:21.292
Welcome back.

00:01:21.833 --> 00:01:26.292
Oh, Mr. Kirin. Thank you for
always looking after Towa.

00:01:26.292 --> 00:01:27.708
It's no trouble at all.

00:01:27.708 --> 00:01:29.375
MOE HIGURASHI
Did you bring me a gift?

00:01:29.375 --> 00:01:31.208
Yes, of course I did.

00:01:31.208 --> 00:01:33.958
Apples! Sis's favorite!

00:01:34.042 --> 00:01:36.917
– These look tasty, I want to eat it now!
– It's gotten closer, hasn't it?

00:01:37.833 --> 00:01:39.708
I believe it's been 500 years.

00:01:39.708 --> 00:01:41.500
What? Where do you mean?

00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:44.417
Well, I don't know the particulars,

00:01:45.208 --> 00:01:51.042
but it's a comet that is said to
approach Earth every 470 years.

00:01:51.042 --> 00:01:54.625
Oh, I've been hearing people
talk about it here and there.

00:01:55.125 --> 00:01:58.208
But it shouldn't be visible yet
to the naked eye.

00:01:59.167 --> 00:02:01.000
I can't see where it is at all.

00:02:01.708 --> 00:02:07.875
<i>I see. So a normal person</i>
<i>can't see that at all.</i>

00:02:09.417 --> 00:02:15.042
<i>I see. So it does appear </i>
<i>in the other era.</i>

00:02:15.042 --> 00:02:16.583
BEAST KING – KIRINMARU

00:02:16.583 --> 00:02:19.083
I suppose I cannot
continue to ignore it.

00:04:01.375 --> 00:04:03.208
"The Three Princesses Strike Back"

00:04:14.708 --> 00:04:17.958
KIRINMARU'S OLDER SISTER – ZERO
This is who I am after all.

00:04:17.958 --> 00:04:20.625
That's fine, isn't it, My Lord?

00:04:21.708 --> 00:04:26.875
All that remains are the finishing touches
for the other half-demon girl.

00:04:27.417 --> 00:04:28.458
Riku.

00:04:28.750 --> 00:04:29.667
I'm here.

00:04:30.208 --> 00:04:32.333
You know, don't you?

00:04:32.583 --> 00:04:37.958
Tell me how the other daughter
can manifest her true powers.

00:04:37.958 --> 00:04:39.708
PIRATE WASHED ASHORE – RIKU
Are you talking about Lady Towa?

00:04:40.333 --> 00:04:42.375
Who else could I be talking about?

00:04:42.833 --> 00:04:48.333
Yes. Lady Towa is the kindest person...

00:04:48.917 --> 00:04:53.583
<i>I see.</i>
<i>So that's how her powers are released.</i>

00:04:54.542 --> 00:04:58.000
So I don't believe she has
any powers hidden within her.

00:04:58.458 --> 00:05:03.250
Oh? Well, if you say so,
then I'll take your word for it.

00:05:03.333 --> 00:05:06.750
Yes. I'm sorry I
couldn't be of more use.

00:05:07.042 --> 00:05:10.875
You're really not good at
telling lies, are you?

00:05:12.208 --> 00:05:13.125
Well, that's fine.

00:05:13.625 --> 00:05:16.750
I'll make some tea.
You should have some.

00:05:22.083 --> 00:05:24.292
BOUNTY HUNTER – MOROHA

00:05:24.292 --> 00:05:27.667
I believe this is a Blood Blade.

00:05:27.667 --> 00:05:28.958
Blood Blade?

00:05:28.958 --> 00:05:30.667
TOWA HIGURASHI, SETSUNA, JYUBEI
What's that?

00:05:30.667 --> 00:05:32.667
TOWA HIGURASHI, SETSUNA, JYUBEI
If you truly are

00:05:32.667 --> 00:05:34.833
the daughters of Sesshomaru,

00:05:34.833 --> 00:05:38.500
then you have inherited
the blood of a great demon.

00:05:38.792 --> 00:05:42.042
This means that
things such as poison claws

00:05:42.042 --> 00:05:46.958
and blades of blood and
demon energy flow within you,

00:05:46.958 --> 00:05:49.958
and at times, your body
will bring these things forth.

00:05:50.500 --> 00:05:52.417
That's what I hear, anyway.

00:05:52.417 --> 00:05:56.333
"That's what you hear"? Mr. Jyubei,
you can be pretty vague sometimes.

00:05:56.333 --> 00:06:00.208
Well, of course, and that's because
I've never seen it with my own eyes.

00:06:00.833 --> 00:06:02.708
So one day I will be able...

00:06:02.708 --> 00:06:03.875
Setsuna?

00:06:03.875 --> 00:06:04.708
...to use this?

00:06:05.208 --> 00:06:07.208
Ask your own blood.

00:06:12.125 --> 00:06:13.750
That was a good night's rest.

00:06:13.750 --> 00:06:14.875
You're up.

00:06:14.875 --> 00:06:19.583
Hey, how're you two doing?
Oh, good morning, Mr. Jyubei.

00:06:19.875 --> 00:06:22.500
Got any juicy bounty hunting jobs?

00:06:22.500 --> 00:06:28.833
I don't know about juicy, but there are
some nice people who'd like to hire you.

00:06:29.125 --> 00:06:31.083
Oh yeah? Who is it?

00:06:31.083 --> 00:06:33.042
– It's me...
– And me.

00:06:33.667 --> 00:06:38.042
We'll pay you our share
of Totetsu's bounty—all of it.

00:06:38.042 --> 00:06:40.125
You two want to hire me?

00:06:40.125 --> 00:06:42.250
What led you to this turn of events?

00:06:42.250 --> 00:06:43.708
Hey!

00:06:43.708 --> 00:06:45.417
This is what you wanted, right?

00:06:45.917 --> 00:06:48.333
MASTER OF HIRAIKOTSU – HISUI
Azusa no Yumihari. Here.

00:06:49.083 --> 00:06:51.667
TAKECHIYO
It's a tsuchigumo web.

00:06:51.667 --> 00:06:55.208
Yeah, this really reeks of
that woman's smell.

00:06:55.917 --> 00:06:57.625
Now we'll know where to find her.

00:06:58.000 --> 00:07:00.333
That woman... Do you mean...

00:07:00.833 --> 00:07:04.208
Once dawn breaks,
we're going to go slay Zero.

00:07:05.917 --> 00:07:09.292
It's time to fully repay my debt to her.

00:07:11.792 --> 00:07:14.958
All right! Let's get to it!

00:07:21.875 --> 00:07:24.917
It's been a while, your Ladyship.

00:07:25.333 --> 00:07:29.833
Kirinmaru, it has been a while.
Are you well?

00:07:29.958 --> 00:07:35.958
Yes, I am. And it's wonderful to see
your Ladyship is beautiful as always.

00:07:36.292 --> 00:07:38.542
SESSHOMARU'S MOTHER
No need for flattery.

00:07:38.542 --> 00:07:41.125
And please,
do stop calling me by that name.

00:07:41.583 --> 00:07:43.667
That era has long since passed.

00:07:44.292 --> 00:07:47.292
It seems my sister has been
causing you some trouble.

00:07:47.750 --> 00:07:50.250
Zero has not changed, has she?

00:07:50.417 --> 00:07:54.750
She seems to be meddling in
the affairs of Sesshomaru's daughters,

00:07:54.875 --> 00:07:56.542
but I struggle to see the point.

00:07:57.167 --> 00:07:58.542
I must agree.

00:07:58.958 --> 00:08:01.583
Well, she can do what she wants.

00:08:02.083 --> 00:08:05.125
I care not what happens to those girls.

00:08:05.208 --> 00:08:08.708
Besides, a half-demon's true worth
comes from survival.

00:08:09.125 --> 00:08:11.000
I am glad to hear that.

00:08:11.500 --> 00:08:14.625
Since I am being targeted by them,

00:08:14.625 --> 00:08:17.708
I'm afraid I simply cannot
let them go unharmed.

00:08:18.917 --> 00:08:19.958
By the way...

00:08:20.583 --> 00:08:22.958
has the Windmill of Time moved at all?

00:08:23.833 --> 00:08:29.708
It has not. I haven't even seen Akuru
these past several years.

00:08:30.042 --> 00:08:35.333
Sesshomaru is having some difficulty
finding Akuru's pinwheel.

00:08:37.167 --> 00:08:40.625
I'm sure that is just Sesshomaru's
way of passing time.

00:08:41.375 --> 00:08:46.000
I think Sesshomaru's true intention
is to take care of his daughters.

00:08:46.625 --> 00:08:51.792
That cannot be possible.
That would almost make him seem human.

00:08:52.417 --> 00:08:53.667
That is true...

00:09:03.333 --> 00:09:04.167
See you later.

00:09:04.792 --> 00:09:06.833
And good luck.

00:09:15.208 --> 00:09:18.750
I've faced many different people
throughout the years,

00:09:19.292 --> 00:09:21.792
but you are beyond understanding.

00:09:22.250 --> 00:09:24.333
What an odd girl you are, truly.

00:09:24.583 --> 00:09:27.958
I can take that as a complement, right?

00:09:28.292 --> 00:09:32.167
Of course.
Show me your hidden demon powers.

00:09:32.167 --> 00:09:34.833
I'd like to see your prowess for myself!

00:09:35.917 --> 00:09:40.333
I knew it. I wasn't wrong when I thought
you smelled like Kirinmaru.

00:09:40.958 --> 00:09:42.875
Would you honor me with a fight?

00:09:43.375 --> 00:09:46.708
Are you fine with me?
Towa's the one you really want, right?

00:09:47.083 --> 00:09:48.750
You got me right where it hurts!

00:09:52.750 --> 00:09:53.792
Cyclone Burst!

00:09:57.417 --> 00:09:59.375
Scourge of Swallows!

00:10:18.458 --> 00:10:19.917
Crimson Dragon Wave!

00:10:22.917 --> 00:10:24.167
Eat this!

00:10:32.667 --> 00:10:38.333
Attempting revenge so soon?
I like you, Half-Demon Princesses!

00:10:38.333 --> 00:10:39.875
Azusa no Yumihari!

00:10:41.625 --> 00:10:43.917
I already know how your attack works.

00:10:43.917 --> 00:10:46.667
I have your life now! Prepare yourself!

00:10:47.875 --> 00:10:51.958
Didn't I tell you that your
Crimson Dragon does not work on me?

00:10:51.958 --> 00:10:53.458
Crimson Dragons favor white clouds!

00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:56.458
Oh, I know.

00:10:57.375 --> 00:10:59.917
I borrowed this "auto-open"
umbrella from Towa!

00:11:00.333 --> 00:11:01.333
Well, then.

00:11:04.292 --> 00:11:06.167
This is what I was really waiting for!

00:11:08.417 --> 00:11:11.333
Crimson Backlash Wave!

00:11:11.792 --> 00:11:12.750
W-What?

00:11:27.125 --> 00:11:28.667
What is that?

00:11:28.667 --> 00:11:32.000
Those are the Master's ashes.

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:33.500
You were here, Grandpa Myoga?

00:11:33.833 --> 00:11:36.292
FLEA DEMON – MYOGA
What are you talking about?

00:11:36.292 --> 00:11:39.333
This Myoga has always been
by your side, Lady Moroha!

00:11:39.625 --> 00:11:41.458
Whatever you say.

00:11:41.458 --> 00:11:45.042
Wait, by "Master," do you mean
grandpa? The Great Dog-Demon?

00:11:45.333 --> 00:11:49.458
Yes, this is where
the Great Dog-Demon perished.

00:11:49.458 --> 00:11:54.958
So it wouldn't be strange if Master's
demon powers had seeped into the dirt.

00:11:56.708 --> 00:12:00.625
Lady Moroha! The Backlash Wave
was originally Tessaiga's technique.

00:12:00.625 --> 00:12:02.917
It was something developed by Master.

00:12:03.292 --> 00:12:05.583
It's hardly surprising if his ashes

00:12:05.583 --> 00:12:09.583
end up diffusing the
reversed flow of demon energy.

00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:13.292
Then what am I supposed to do...
Nevermind!

00:12:13.542 --> 00:12:16.417
I guess I just gotta go with the flow!

00:12:22.417 --> 00:12:25.625
Looks like we've been surrounded.

00:12:26.000 --> 00:12:28.958
At least you should be able to get away.

00:12:28.958 --> 00:12:31.875
I would never do
such a heartless thing, Madam.

00:12:32.375 --> 00:12:36.750
Madam? Then, the one
who you said looked after you is...

00:12:37.208 --> 00:12:38.458
It's her, yes.

00:12:40.125 --> 00:12:43.583
That's why you shouldn't have
given him the Silver Pearl.

00:12:43.583 --> 00:12:47.542
So we can assume that both of you
are in league with Kirinmaru?

00:12:47.958 --> 00:12:50.583
Well, I can neither confirm nor deny that.

00:12:50.750 --> 00:12:51.875
Lady Moroha!

00:12:51.875 --> 00:12:56.583
It's out of the question to battle at
the place where Master passed away!

00:12:56.583 --> 00:12:58.542
You should retreat for now.

00:12:59.167 --> 00:13:03.500
So I get that it's not good to fight here.
But you know...

00:13:03.833 --> 00:13:05.083
What is it?

00:13:05.083 --> 00:13:07.500
That doesn't matter right now!

00:13:07.500 --> 00:13:09.542
Why back down
from a fight we could win?

00:13:10.000 --> 00:13:13.958
W-What a disrespectful granddaughter
you are to your grandfather!

00:13:13.958 --> 00:13:15.792
Why did I bother?

00:13:15.792 --> 00:13:17.042
There he goes.

00:13:17.042 --> 00:13:21.250
Why don't you return the Silver Pearl
that you took from Towa?

00:13:22.333 --> 00:13:24.167
Go ahead Riku, give it back.

00:13:24.167 --> 00:13:26.917
You have to be joking.

00:13:27.083 --> 00:13:30.792
I went through so much trouble
to gather all the Rainbow Pearls here.

00:13:30.792 --> 00:13:31.958
What?

00:13:41.250 --> 00:13:47.208
You've gathered all the Pearls?
It wasn't just the Silver Pearl you stole?

00:13:47.625 --> 00:13:50.958
Nope. I have five here on me,

00:13:51.333 --> 00:13:56.625
plus the Gold in Setsuna's right eye
and the Red in Moroha's rouge.

00:13:57.000 --> 00:13:58.542
How humiliating.

00:13:58.875 --> 00:14:05.000
To think all my tears return to me
at the place where he died...

00:14:05.750 --> 00:14:07.875
This must be some kind of fate as well.

00:14:08.417 --> 00:14:12.750
I was meaning to hand them to you
after I had them all, but...

00:14:13.042 --> 00:14:14.458
How dare you!

00:14:15.208 --> 00:14:18.833
How dare you bring back
these Pearls to me.

00:14:19.625 --> 00:14:24.750
I will show you who
the true owner of these Pearls are!

00:14:40.500 --> 00:14:41.917
Setsuna!

00:14:41.917 --> 00:14:46.125
<i>The Blood Blade started acting up </i>
<i>as soon as the Gold Pearl flew out!</i>

00:14:48.417 --> 00:14:49.667
Don't get so full of yourself!

00:14:52.458 --> 00:14:53.708
Stop it!

00:15:15.500 --> 00:15:19.333
SESSHOMARU'S VASSAL – JAKEN
Lord Sesshomaru, that pinwheel just now...

00:15:19.333 --> 00:15:22.458
TOWA AND SETSUNA'S FATHER – SESSHOMARU
It was Akuru. There's no mistake.

00:15:24.958 --> 00:15:26.833
W-Will you not give chase?

00:15:30.208 --> 00:15:31.833
Lord Sesshomaru.

00:15:43.042 --> 00:15:45.292
The Windmill of Time has moved.

00:15:46.458 --> 00:15:48.917
TOWA AND SETSUNA'S MOTHER – RIN

00:15:51.917 --> 00:15:53.667
Madam. Madam!

00:15:54.083 --> 00:15:56.583
Please hang in there, Madam!

00:16:00.292 --> 00:16:01.292
Rin?

00:16:04.292 --> 00:16:07.833
Zero is dying. Who struck her?

00:16:16.458 --> 00:16:20.958
So this is the Underworld. I see.

00:16:23.083 --> 00:16:24.500
Oh, Zero.

00:16:24.583 --> 00:16:26.833
Planning to pass
without even a greeting?

00:16:27.583 --> 00:16:29.917
We were not that close, I suppose.

00:16:30.417 --> 00:16:33.625
So age has finally gotten to you?
How auspicious.

00:16:33.917 --> 00:16:37.625
No, I was killed by Sesshomaru's daughter.

00:16:39.083 --> 00:16:40.625
Oh, that is hilarious.

00:16:41.125 --> 00:16:43.208
I didn't say a joke.

00:16:43.583 --> 00:16:46.667
You got so wound up over those girls.

00:16:47.125 --> 00:16:49.208
That's what meddling gets you.

00:16:49.917 --> 00:16:51.792
You may be right.

00:16:52.125 --> 00:16:55.500
Regardless, I'm feeling much better now.

00:16:55.500 --> 00:17:01.000
And that's because Sesshomaru
must be feeling downright miserable.

00:17:01.375 --> 00:17:02.750
Is that so?

00:17:03.125 --> 00:17:09.708
The human who is Sesshomaru's
wife is still connected to me.

00:17:09.875 --> 00:17:12.625
If I die, then she dies as well.

00:17:14.417 --> 00:17:16.292
This is so delightful.

00:17:16.958 --> 00:17:20.292
I'm sure she will soon pass this way.

00:17:23.167 --> 00:17:28.958
Say, when Izayoi passed through here
in the past, how did you feel?

00:17:30.292 --> 00:17:34.667
Didn't you feel just as relieved
as I am now?

00:17:35.542 --> 00:17:37.917
<i>Didn't your heart just dance?</i>

00:17:39.125 --> 00:17:42.000
<i>After all, Izayoi is the woman</i>
<i>who led him to his death.</i>

00:17:42.125 --> 00:17:44.458
<i>You couldn't help but feel disdain.</i>

00:17:44.458 --> 00:17:45.333
How boorish.

00:17:45.875 --> 00:17:48.083
These are my last moments.

00:17:48.500 --> 00:17:52.750
Can't you spare me your
falsehoods at the very least?

00:17:52.958 --> 00:17:57.333
An offering to the woman who wasn't
chosen by the Great Dog-Demon.

00:17:59.500 --> 00:18:05.375
I have no interest in humans,
and I have no words to offer you.

00:18:06.333 --> 00:18:07.625
I see.

00:18:09.792 --> 00:18:14.625
I have no offering, but Zero,
what was it that you wanted to do?

00:18:15.750 --> 00:18:19.625
I just wanted to protect Kirinmaru
from humans and half-demons.

00:18:21.083 --> 00:18:23.875
And you're telling me to
spare you falsehoods!

00:18:24.875 --> 00:18:29.500
You still talk like you can see through
everything. I don't like you after all.

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:32.750
<i>I shall take that as a compliment.</i>

00:18:32.750 --> 00:18:35.708
I hate humans and half-demons.

00:18:36.250 --> 00:18:41.167
Especially those who did nothing more
than inherit the Great Dog-Demon's blood.

00:18:41.417 --> 00:18:46.375
So it was jealousy!
How incredibly human of you.

00:18:46.375 --> 00:18:47.833
A human?

00:18:49.125 --> 00:18:50.042
How dare you!

00:18:50.583 --> 00:18:51.667
Madam!

00:19:04.542 --> 00:19:05.625
You're...

00:19:05.625 --> 00:19:06.875
Sesshomaru.

00:19:09.458 --> 00:19:12.583
Why didn't you use your own blade?

00:19:13.292 --> 00:19:18.000
I cut her with this.
Is this not my own blade?

00:19:36.333 --> 00:19:38.500
What part of me is human-like?

00:19:39.083 --> 00:19:43.750
Women who burn from love...
how pitiful.

00:19:45.917 --> 00:19:47.625
Did he just cut something?

00:19:54.292 --> 00:19:55.750
She came back to life?

00:19:59.625 --> 00:20:02.542
That was a close one, Rin.

00:20:02.958 --> 00:20:05.250
But why? How did she come back to life?

00:20:05.708 --> 00:20:08.792
It's the Tenseiga!
I've heard rumors about it.

00:20:08.792 --> 00:20:09.750
Tenseiga?

00:20:10.125 --> 00:20:12.083
I don't know the details,

00:20:12.333 --> 00:20:18.875
but Sesshomaru's Tenseiga is a sword
that saves the lives of the weak.

00:20:19.208 --> 00:20:21.500
So that's why that woman
came back to life.

00:20:21.500 --> 00:20:23.083
Damn it, it was you!

00:20:23.208 --> 00:20:24.542
Sesshomaru!

00:20:25.750 --> 00:20:28.583
Don't tell me you used the Tenseiga!

00:20:30.833 --> 00:20:34.542
I won't forgive you.
I won't forgive you, Sesshomaru.

00:20:34.542 --> 00:20:40.417
Of all things, how could you have used
his fang to bring me back to life?

00:20:41.375 --> 00:20:43.375
I knew of no other method.

00:20:45.292 --> 00:20:46.875
Madam, please calm down.

00:20:50.792 --> 00:20:52.708
<i>Living in this world is hard.</i>

00:20:53.708 --> 00:20:57.958
<i>If you don't follow the set rules,</i>
<i>you're treated as an outcast.</i>

00:20:58.917 --> 00:21:03.125
<i>I was so tired of it when I </i>
<i>was in the other world.</i>

00:21:03.583 --> 00:21:05.125
I won't forgive you!

00:21:05.833 --> 00:21:10.750
<i>What Zero is feeling now </i>
<i>is probably like how I felt back then.</i>

00:21:11.000 --> 00:21:12.750
I will never forgive you!

00:21:17.208 --> 00:21:18.458
Tenseiga.

00:21:18.708 --> 00:21:21.292
I had lost my sense of self.

00:21:21.708 --> 00:21:27.583
I had always thought to leave disposing
of your daughters to Kirinmaru.

00:21:28.292 --> 00:21:34.667
But I can't take it anymore.
I will deal with your little brats myself!

00:21:35.125 --> 00:21:39.708
I will no longer falter.
This is who I am after all.

00:21:39.708 --> 00:21:44.583
Riku, bring me the Rainbow Pearls,
the source of my demon powers.

00:21:44.583 --> 00:21:46.375
But Madam, please wait!

00:21:57.417 --> 00:21:58.875
Kirinmaru?

00:22:01.875 --> 00:22:03.750
I was wondering when he'd show up.

00:22:04.875 --> 00:22:08.292
No wonder Grandpa Myoga
bolted when he could.

00:23:43.000 --> 00:24:00.625
NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW

00:24:00.625 --> 00:24:04.000
Next time on <i>Yashahime: Princess Half-Demon</i>,
the last episode...

00:24:04.500 --> 00:24:24.064
"Sesshomaru's Daughter"
